# one-nginx APK payload.
#
# Identity of this image: Nginx plus the glibc/ssl runtime it needs.
# Filename globs are resolved from /Repository/x86_64 at image build
# (unsigned, --allow-untrusted). A signed APKINDEX is a netinstall concern.
#
auzix-nginx-*.apk
auzix-runtime-glibc-*.apk
auzix-libgcc-s1-*.apk
gcc-14-base-*.apk
libssl3t64-*.apk
libcrypt1-*.apk

# Validation-era extras for Podman/Docker layout proofs. These are not the
# identity of zero/one. Once the ladder is stable they drop off the smaller
# images. Do not promote them into BaseLayout/BusyBox.
#
# Network: real curl (BusyBox already ships wget). Curl is the first
# non-applet HTTP client on the ladder.
curl-*.apk
#
# Debug spine: ldd via auzix-au-zi-x-debug-tools (glibc loader --list).
# stat/strings/wget stay BusyBox applets on zero; do not pull libc-bin or
# binutils into this image. `file` needs libmagic-mgc (~10MB) — not cheap
# here; add it on a later, larger validation image if needed.
auzix-au-zi-x-debug-tools-*.apk
